Docker Network Creation on App Server 2
Problem: Create a docker network named beta on App Server 2 using bridge drivers with subnet 172.168.0.0/24 and iprange 172.168.0.0/24.

Solution:

bash
# Create the docker network
sudo docker network create \
  --driver bridge \
  --subnet=172.168.0.0/24 \
  --ip-range=172.168.0.0/24 \
  beta

# Verify
sudo docker network ls | grep beta
sudo docker network inspect beta
